 Yes! This is definitely possible using Jira’s built-in functionality. Here are some steps you can follow to accomplish this:
1. Create a custom field on your project which contains the name of each required item on the checklist, for example “item_1”, “item_2” etc.
2. Add the following code to the rules section of the Jira workflow:
“if (${customfield_name} == “done”) {
move_issue_to_column(column_name);
If you are having trouble implementing this feature, please let me know and I would be happy to help further.

